    "body": "If there's a non-`auto` `min-block-size` on the container (as there is in this example), then we transfer it through, subtracting away whatever is needed for the `legend`:\r\nhttps://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/9e3413f54ed6c9165b5659558091d766d34a731f/layout/forms/nsFieldSetFrame.cpp#580-591\r\n\r\nSo in this case we directly transfer through `min-height:200px` to the anonymous block, so it does its sizing and layout like a flex container with `height:auto;min-height:200px`",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
