    "body": "(The relevant line there is `kidReflowInput.SetComputedMinBSize(...)` which is setting the computed `min-height` on the anonymous box. And we're setting it to `aReflowInput.ComputedMinBSize()` i.e. the fieldset's own resolved `min-height`, minus `mLegendSpace`.)",
