    "updated_at": "2023-04-19T12:49:39Z",
    "body": "So\r\n\r\n> - The used value of the 'block-size' property is expected to be 100%, subtracting the size of the rendered legend (if any) on the block axis, and if the fieldset's used value of `box-sizing` is `content-box`, then also subtracting the size of borders and paddings on the block axis.\r\n> - The used value of the 'min-block-size' and 'max-block-size' properties are expected to be the used value of the same property of the fieldset element, subtracting the size of the rendered legend (if any) on the block axis, and if the fieldset's used value of `box-sizing` is `content-box`, then also subtracting the size of borders and paddings on the block axis.",
